 "notes": [
  "Rows 2026-11-20 (lane houthavens-memel-wiborg-20261120, round 3): built 2023 and the 3DBAG survey is 2023, so the shell is the finished block. SE: panel 29 (47 m, eaves 13.5) from w01-140s2x/s3x (2025-09-29): a glazed ground and three storeys with brick-fronted balconies on every other bay (balconies.brick, solid parapet in the wall brick); panel 48 (18.6 m, five storeys) from w01-140s1x: wide windows and a loggia column; panel 55 (16.4 m) from w01-140s4x: small punched windows and a balcony column at its end. NE: panel 4 (30.5 m) from w03-50s2x (2024-10-16): grey brick galleries with timber frames (drawn as bar-railed balconies in a timber colour); panel 54 from w03-50s1x. The 2021-2022 SE crops are construction and are not cited. The W and NW fronts have no crop: otherWalls. Round 4: the SE brick balcony boxes have a pale concrete slab edge; the NE galleries have concrete fins at every bay joint (balconies.posts) and pale concrete slabs. NE panels 69 and 91 (the set-back middle) in the same grey brick (round 4: the buff default read wrong against w03-50s2x).",
  "Not drawn: the timber pergola posts rising over the NE roof line, the parapet notches of the SE balcony boxes."
 ]
